        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Embroidered silk and silver threads on crimson silk ground.  Linen or canvas lining.  The dead Christ figure lying at the centre on a stone slab, two angels with liturgical fans to his left and right; in the corners, busts of the four Evangelists.  A Greek inscription runs around the outside in gold thread."@en ;
